# Normalise line endings in the repository to LF.
#
# core.autocrlf=true on the Windows checkout was converting files to CRLF on
# touch, so multi-line template literals carried a stray \r and local builds
# differed from Cloudflare (Linux) builds by a few bytes. Index already held
# LF; this makes the working tree agree on next checkout.
* text=auto eol=lf
